{"candidateAnswer":"Three turtles","evidence":"[D8:3 | 6:44 pm on 17 April, 2022] Nate: Sounds fun! I probably also have loads of books I haven't read in years. Sounds like a blast from the past!\n[D28:23 | 5:54 pm on 9 November, 2022] Nate: That sounds incredible! Nature truly has a way of reminding us to appreciate the beauty around us, and moments like those really stay with you. These critters also make me appreciate life's little joys. And guess what? I got them a new friend!","itemId":"urn:uuid:dcced280-9f99-5cba-bfb2-f60da0cb4abc","provenance":{"sourceCommitment":"sha256:b04ca339173644c1a0c3131b9d99a3513fef349f3ae9f660aaad75e8fafc8e3f","timestamp":"2026-04-02T14:22:55Z"},"question":"How many turtles does Nate have?","referenceAnswer":"Three","sources":[{"digest":{"sha256":"b04ca339173644c1a0c3131b9d99a3513fef349f3ae9f660aaad75e8fafc8e3f"}}]}